    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "a03854d7-7c48-4175-a3b4-439e35f4ae88",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Hitman 7. Episode 1. Ambrose cartel",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ROCKY_DUGONG",
        "PublicId": "134883179720",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Rocky/scene_dugong.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 1a1cf4ed-c966-4a28-ba36-4dbb52d6a14e).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47, and welcome back to Ambrose island. Today our client living on Ambrose island called me to say that he and the whole neighborhood have raised money so that we could come and eliminate a drug and criminal gang living in the neighborhood, called The pirots. So tonight we have four of the biggest leaders of the gang, I just got a tip that there is a snitch among the neighbors who has told the pirates about your arrival. I would recommend the sniper rifle 47. Good luck.",
